# Mandatory authorization boundary: never serve paiver.php or its backups.
Require all denied
# Host-generated internal 403 bodies reveal filesystem details. Apache can
# redirect the denied request to the public editor without serving its bytes.
# If 50webs disallows external ErrorDocument, the denial MUST remain in place.
ErrorDocument 403 https://paige-lighthouse.50webs.org/Indium/paiver/
